Here is the updated, feature-complete SAM-SCANNER Pro single-file web application.

What Was Fixed & Added
Back Navigation & Exit Fix (Hardware / Gesture Back):

Root Cause: Modern mobile browsers and PWAs close or exit the page when the physical back button or edge-swipe gesture is used if the application does not manage the browser's History API.

Resolution: Integrated a dedicated History State Machine (history.pushState and window.addEventListener('popstate')).

Pressing Back while viewing a modal sheet closes the modal without leaving your current view.

Pressing Back in Review returns to the Crop & Adjust screen.

Pressing Back in Crop returns to the Camera.

Pressing Back in Camera closes the stream and returns to Home.

Pressing Back on the Home dashboard displays a "Press back again to exit" toast (requires a second tap within 2.2 seconds to exit).

All in-app back buttons (✕, ❮ Retake, ❮ Back) now invoke window.history.back(), keeping software and hardware buttons in complete sync.

Interactive 4-Corner Crop & Perspective Warp with Magnifier Loupe:

After snapping a photo or choosing an image from your gallery, the app opens an interactive cropping canvas.

4 draggable corner handles allow precision adjustment before dewarping.

Includes a floating 2.5x Magnifying Loupe with crosshairs positioned above your touch point so your finger never blocks the corner view.

One-tap quick actions: 🪄 Auto Detect, ⏹️ Full Image, and 🔄 Rotate 90°.

Multi-Page & Batch Scanning Mode:

Single vs. Batch mode toggle.

In Batch mode, you can snap continuous pages without interruption. A real-time thumbnail and counter badge (1, 2, 3...) appear in the shutter deck.

In Review, a multi-page thumbnail reel lets you switch between pages, delete individual pages, append new pages via + Add Page, and export all pages into a single multi-page PDF.

ID Card 2-Shot Composite Mode:

Dedicated ID Card scanner with on-screen bounding guide.

Step 1 captures the Front side; Step 2 captures the Back side.

Automatically stitches both sides onto a formatted, centered A4 document sheet ready for printing or PDF export.

Live Flash / Torch & Camera Flip:

toggleFlash() now queries the camera stream's hardware torch capability via MediaStreamTrack.applyConstraints({ advanced: [{ torch: state }] }) with glowing visual feedback.

Added a front/rear camera flip toggle (🔄).

Full OCR Text Extraction (Tesseract.js):

Real-time neural OCR extraction progress bar (0% to 100%).

Copy recognized text to clipboard, download as .txt, or export directly to Word format.

Expanded Document Filters & Fine-Tuning:

Magic Color (CamScanner paper whitening & ink enhancement)

Sharp B&W (adaptive high-contrast binary threshold)

Grayscale (smooth 256-level monochrome)

Original (unfiltered color)

Toner Saver (lightened background for ink saving)

Invert (chalkboard / negative contrast)

Real-time Brightness and Contrast adjustment sliders.

Electronic Signature & Anti-Theft Watermark:

Responsive touch/mouse canvas signature pad with ink color selection (Black, Blue, Red). Tapping Apply Signature stamps the signature onto the document.

Watermark generator supporting custom text, opacity slider, and Diagonal Center or Full Grid Tile styles.

PDF & Office Export Suite:

Multi-page A4 PDF generation.

Merge Images to PDF tool.

Password encryption lock prompt.

Image to Word (.doc) and Image to Excel (.csv) table converter.

Document Management:

Inline document rename (✏️) and deletion (🗑️) with confirmation.

Live search filter across saved documents.

Non-intrusive floating toast notifications replacing disruptive browser alerts.

