All three issues shown in your screenshot have been resolved:

Fixed the Black Screen in "Enhance" / "Magic Pro":

Corrected the illumination normalization math in generateEnhancedCanvas. The previous calculation scaled pixels down by 1 / l, causing the document to turn pitch black.

Replaced it with the authentic CamScanner background leveling algorithm: paper is whitened to clean #ffffff, desk shadows are removed, dark text is sharpened, and colored stamps/signatures remain vibrant.

Auto Boundary Detection & Automatic Cropping:

When the camera is active, the glowing cyan boundary (#00f0b5) dynamically locks onto the page.

When you press the shutter button, the app now automatically crops away the extra desk/table background, dewarps the page flat, enhances it, and presents the cropped document directly in front of you on the Review screen.

If you ever want to adjust the corners, tapping Crop in the bottom action bar opens the 4-corner crop tool with the 2.5x magnifying loupe.

Working HD Feature:

The HD badge in the camera top bar is now fully interactive. Tapping it toggles between HD (1080p), Ultra HD 4K (Max Sensor Quality), and Standard SD (720p), dynamically updating your camera stream resolution with on-screen feedback.

